--!
--! True when `{{ internal_schema }}.lo(r) <= {{ schema }}.{{ b.extractor }}(a) <= {{ internal_schema }}.hi(r)`.
--! The range is one operand, so a statement cannot pair the low bound of one
--! query with the high bound of another (ADR-0009, decision 7):
--! `WHERE {{ schema }}.between(col, $1::{{ schema }}.{{ b.range }})`.
--!
--! @param a {{ b.column }} Encrypted column value
--! @param r {{ schema }}.{{ b.range }} Range query operand: both bounds of one `BETWEEN`
--! @return boolean True when the value is in the range; NULL when either argument is NULL
