--! @note `BETWEEN` is an SQL keyword, so call it schema-qualified:
--!       `{{ schema }}.between(...)` parses, a bare `between(...)` does not.
--! @note Cast the range to its exact domain, `$1::{{ schema }}.{{ b.range }}`.
